{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19609","headline":"郡斋三月下旬作 · 崔护","name":"郡斋三月下旬作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春事日已歇，池塘旷幽寻。\n残红披独坠，嫩绿间浅深。\n偃仰卷芳褥，顾步爱新阴。\n谋春未及竟，夏初遽见侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔护","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}